msgstr "我做不到。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT"
msgid "Just a little further, arrow."
msgstr "再過去一點就好，箭頭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT_DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT_DONE"
msgid "I did it!"
msgstr "我做到了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ACIDBATS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ACIDBATS"
msgid "Wings overhead! Watch for acid!"
msgstr "頭頂有翅膀聲！小心酸液！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ADVENTUREFAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ADVENTUREFAIL"
msgid "You win this time, Maxwell."
msgstr "這次算你贏，麥斯威爾。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.1"
msgid "The ground's cracking!"
msgstr "地面都開裂了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.2"
msgid "Tread carefully!"
msgstr "腳下小心！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.3"
msgid "Earthquake!"
msgstr "地震！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.1"
msgid "I brought you something."
msgstr "我給您帶了點東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.2"
msgid "Dinner is served."
msgstr "晚餐準備好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.3"
msgid "Great Antlion, please accept this tribute."
msgstr "偉大的蟻獅，請收下這份貢品。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_NEW_KNOWLEDGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_NEW_KNOWLEDGE"
msgid "Useful study material. I'll commit it to memory."
msgstr "很有用的學習資料。我會把它記下來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_NO_POWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_NO_POWER"
msgid "Well. That was exciting."
msgstr "嗯。真是令人興奮呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_OLD_KNOWLEDGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_OLD_KNOWLEDGE"
msgid "I've covered this before. Good review, though."
msgstr "這個我學過了。不過複習一下也好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.1"
msgid "I probably shouldn't be here."
msgstr "我可能不應該在這裡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.2"
msgid "This seems dangerous!"
msgstr "這看起來很危險！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.3"
msgid "What was that?!"
msgstr "那是什麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_ATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_ATTACK"
msgid "Attack distance secured. I can press in."
msgstr "攻擊距離已確保，可以壓上去了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK"
msgid "Sparky! I like!"
msgstr "噼啪作響！我喜歡！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY"
msgid "Ha. Take that, water."
msgstr "哈。這下水也拿我沒辦法了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION"
msgid "Defensive posture set. I can receive safely."
msgstr "防禦姿勢已就位，可以安心接招了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE"
msgid "I feel wide awake. It's a little unnatural."
msgstr "我一點都不想睡，反而有點不自然。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS"
msgid "Where did all this motivation come from?"
msgstr "這股幹勁是從哪裡來的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_BECOMEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_BECOMEGHOST"
msgid "Ooooh... I'm a ghost, aren't I."
msgstr "嗚……我變成幽靈了，對吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_BEES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_BEES"
msgid "Bees! Everyone, be careful!"
msgstr "蜜蜂！大家小心！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_LEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_LEAK"
msgid "The water is coming in. I don't love that."
msgstr "水滲進來了，這可不太妙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINK"
msgid "I'm taking on water. I may drown."
msgstr "船在進水，我可能要淹死了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_BOOMERANG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_BOOMERANG"
msgid "I should try to catch that!"
msgstr "我得試著接住它！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_BRAVERY_POTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_BRAVERY_POTION"
msgid "Ha. Those bats don't frighten me now."
msgstr "哈。那些蝙蝠現在嚇不倒我了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_BURNT"
msgid "Burn damage confirmed. I'll manage the fire more strictly next time."
msgstr "確認燒傷。下次我會更嚴格地控制火勢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CALL_BEEF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CALL_BEEF"
msgid "Beefalo, come here please."
msgstr "牛牛，請過來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CANFIX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CANFIX"
msgid "\nI think I can fix this."
msgstr "\n我想我可以修好它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_INGREDIENTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_INGREDIENTS"
msgid "I need more stuff."
msgstr "我需要更多東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_STATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_STATION"
msgid "I can't make it right now."
msgstr "我現在做不出來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_TECH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_TECH"
msgid "I'm  not sure how to make that yet..."
msgstr "我還不知道怎麼做……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CANTBUILDHERE_YOTB_POST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CANTBUILDHERE_YOTB_POST"
msgid "The judge won't see my beefalo from this far away."
msgstr "離這麼遠，裁判看不到我的牛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CANT_ESCAPE_CURSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CANT_ESCAPE_CURSE"
msgid "Wait, why is this in my pocket again? I'm sure I just..."
msgstr "等等，這個怎麼又回到我口袋裡了？我明明剛才……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_FELL_ASLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_FELL_ASLEEP"
msgid "Wake up, please."
msgstr "請醒醒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_STUNNED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_STUNNED"
msgid "Reflexes aren't my strong point, are they?"
msgstr "反應不是它的強項，對吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_WALKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_WALKING"
msgid "Could we perhaps go a little faster?"
msgstr "我們能不能走快一點？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_WRONG_WAY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_WRONG_WAY.1"
msgid "Wrong lane. The finish line is the other way."
msgstr "跑錯賽道了。終點在另一邊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_WRONG_WAY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_WRONG_WAY.2"
msgid "Not that direction. This way, please."
msgstr "不是那邊。請走這邊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_START_RACE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_START_RACE"
msgid "All right, let's win that prize."
msgstr "好了，我們去贏下那個獎品吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CAVEIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CAVEIN"
msgid "I should protect my head."
msgstr "我應該保護好頭部。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CHAIR_ON_FIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CHAIR_ON_FIRE"
msgid "Oops, so hot!"
msgstr "哎呀，好熱啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CHARLIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CHARLIE"
msgid "No reckless movement. Confirming the situation first."
msgstr "不可輕舉妄動，先確認情況。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CHARLIE_ATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CHARLIE_ATTACK"
msgid "Hey! You coward!"
msgstr "嘿！你這個膽小鬼！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_COLD"
msgid "So cold!"
msgstr "好冷啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_COMPASS_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_COMPASS_OUT"
msgid "The needle is stuck."
msgstr "指針卡住了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_COZY_SLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_COZY_SLEEP"
msgid "I think I needed that."
msgstr "我想我正需要這個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CRAFTING_FAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CRAFTING_FAIL"
msgid "I'm missing something."
msgstr "我缺少一些東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DAMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DAMP"
msgid "Oh dear."
msgstr "哎呀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DEERCLOPS"
msgid "That sounded like something very large and very unfriendly."
msgstr "那聽起來像是很大、又很不友善的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DESPAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DESPAWN"
msgid "A bright light..."
msgstr "一道亮光……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ATTACK"
msgid "My attacking edge dropped. Resetting my stance."
msgstr "攻擊優勢下降了，重新調整架勢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK"
msgid "Lightning gone."
msgstr "閃電消失了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY"
msgid "Back to watching for puddles, then."
msgstr "那麼，又得開始留意水坑了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION"
msgid "Might not be the best time to pick a fight."
msgstr "現在可能不是打架的好時機。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE"
msgid "Focus is fading. Rest is part of discipline too."
msgstr "注意力在減退。休息也是修行的一部分。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS"
msgid "Well. The motivation didn't last."
msgstr "嗯。這股幹勁沒能持續多久。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DIG_DISEASE_WARNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DIG_DISEASE_WARNING"
msgid "It looks better already."
msgstr "看起來已經好多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DUSK"
msgid "It's getting late. It will be dark soon."
msgstr "天色已晚了。很快天就黑了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_EAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_EAT.GENERIC"
msgid "Yummy!"
msgstr "好吃！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_EAT.INVALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_EAT.INVALID"
msgid "I'm not sure how I'd eat that."
msgstr "我不知道這個該怎麼吃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_EAT.PAINFUL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_EAT.PAINFUL"
msgid "Ow. That hurt."
msgstr "好痛。真疼啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_EAT.SPOILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_EAT.SPOILED"
msgid "That was not good. Not good at all."
msgstr "這可不好，一點都不好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_EAT.STALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_EAT.STALE"
msgid "Oops, it's so unpalatable."
msgstr "哎呀，實在是太難吃了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_EAT.YUCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_EAT.YUCKY"
msgid "No, thank you."
msgstr "不了，謝謝。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_EATING_NOT_FEASTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_EATING_NOT_FEASTING"
msgid "Very well, I'll share with everyone."
msgstr "好吧，我會和大家分享的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.1"
msgid "Heavy..."
msgstr "好重……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.10"
msgid "Left foot... Right foot..."
msgstr "左腳……右腳……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.11"
msgid "I'm all sweaty. I need to cool off."
msgstr "我渾身是汗，得涼快一下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.2"
msgid "This... is... the worst..."
msgstr "這……真是……太糟了……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.3"
msgid "I can feel the burn... I hate it!"
msgstr "我感覺到灼燒感了……真討厭！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.4"
msgid "Exercise... sucks!"
msgstr "鍛鍊……糟透了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.5"
msgid "Hnnfhg!"
msgstr "哼哼！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.6"
msgid "Why am I doing this...?!"
msgstr "我為什麼要這麼做……？！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.7"
msgid "Oof."
msgstr "嗚。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.8"
msgid "Unghhh!"
msgstr "呃呃！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.9"
msgid "There's... no way this is worth it!"
msgstr "這……根本……不值得！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_DARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_DARK"
msgid "It's so dark!"
msgstr "天太黑了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_LIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_LIGHT"
msgid "I can see again!"
msgstr "我又能看見了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_ARRIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_ARRIVE"
msgid "What is that- a giant floating eyeball?!"
msgstr "那是什麼——巨大的漂浮眼球？！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYAWAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYAWAY"
msgid "Get back here, I'm not finished with you yet!"
msgstr "快回來，我還沒跟你打完！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYBACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYBACK"
msgid "Finally!"
msgstr "終於來了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_FAN_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_FAN_OUT"
msgid "The fan broke. Well, it had a good run."
msgstr "扇子壞了。嗯，它也算盡力了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_FERTILIZER_RESEARCHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_FERTILIZER_RESEARCHED"
msgid "Fundamentals matter. This study is not wasted."
msgstr "基礎很重要，這番學習沒有白費。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN.1"
msgid "Owie, that was not a nice plant!"
msgstr "噢，那可不是什麼好植物！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN.2"
msgid "Ouch, that's hot!"
msgstr "哎喲，好燙！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN_DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN_DONE"
msgid "Huh. I was kind of getting used to it."
msgstr "哈。我都有點習慣了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_FLARE_SEEN
