#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_LOW"
