msgstr "我看得到你在裡面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_MED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_MED"
