msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPONFIRE"
msgid "It's just the collapsing that concerns me."
msgstr "我擔心的只是它會塌下來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_NOWARDROBEONFIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_NOWARDROBEONFIRE"
msgid "There's an active fire. Changing outfits is unsafe."
msgstr "附近有火，現在換裝不安全。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_NO_TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_NO_TRAP"
msgid "Well, that was easy."
msgstr "嗯，真簡單。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_BADCAST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_BADCAST"
msgid "This really isn't my thing."
msgstr "這真不是我的強項。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_GOTAWAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_GOTAWAY"
msgid "It got away. I'll time the pull more precisely next cast."
msgstr "它跑了。下次我會把收線的時機抓得更準。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.1"
msgid "Where are the fish?"
msgstr "魚在哪裡？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.2"
msgid "Hmmm"
msgstr "嗯嗯"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.3"
msgid "Zzzzzzzzz"
msgstr "呼呼呼……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.4"
msgid "Maybe I should find a better fishing spot."
msgstr "也許我應該找一個更好的釣魚點。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINESNAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINESNAP"
msgid "Line snapped. I'll inspect the gear and retry."
msgstr "線斷了。檢查一下裝備再試一次。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINETOOLOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINETOOLOOSE"
msgid "Better start reeling or it's going to get away!"
msgstr "最好開始收線，不然它要跑了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OCEAN_SILHOUETTE_INCOMING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OCEAN_SILHOUETTE_INCOMING"
msgid "Something big's coming!"
msgstr "有個大傢伙要來了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OFF_SCRIPT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OFF_SCRIPT"
msgid "Oh, no!"
msgstr "喔，不！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_PECKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_PECKED"
msgid "Please stop that, bird."
msgstr "鳥兒，請別這樣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_PETRIFED_TREES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_PETRIFED_TREES"
msgid "Something strange is happening."
msgstr "發生了一些奇怪的事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_PICK_DISEASE_WARNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_PICK_DISEASE_WARNING"
msgid "Better not touch that."
msgstr "最好別碰那個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_PIRATES_ARRIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_PIRATES_ARRIVE"
msgid "That sound is getting closer."
msgstr "那個聲音越來越近了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RANDOMSEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RANDOMSEED"
msgid "I guess we'll see what happens."
msgstr "等著看會長出什麼吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RESEARCHED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RESEARCHED.1"
msgid "Plant knowledge helps in real work too. Logged."
msgstr "植物知識在實際工作中也有用。記下了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_POCKETWATCH_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_POCKETWATCH_PORTAL"
msgid "Ow... that was rough."
msgstr "哎喲……這趟可真折騰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE"
msgid "That sound probably doesn't mean good things."
msgstr "那聲音可能並不意味著什麼好事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_REPELLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_REPELLED"
msgid "That's hardly fair."
msgstr "這也太不公平了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH"
msgid "That was useful."
msgstr "這很有用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_FROM_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_FROM_CORPSE"
msgid "Thank you for the hand."
msgstr "謝謝您拉我一把。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_OTHER_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_OTHER_CORPSE"
msgid "Stay with me, you'll be fine."
msgstr "撐住，你會沒事的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE"
msgid "Please, get up."
msgstr "請起來吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.1"
msgid "Your Majesty."
msgstr "陛下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.2"
msgid "Your Highness."
msgstr "殿下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.3"
msgid "My respects, Your Majesty."
msgstr "向您致意，陛下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_RUINS_RESET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_RUINS_RESET"
msgid "Reset confirmed. I'll reorganize and clear it again."
msgstr "確認重置。我會重新整理，再清理一遍。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_NO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_NO"
msgid "How rude."
msgstr "真沒禮貌。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES"
msgid "That did it."
msgstr "這樣就可以了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SCRAPBOOK_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SCRAPBOOK_FULL"
msgid "Looks like stuff I already know."
msgstr "看來都是我已經知道的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SHADOW_RIFT_MAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SHADOW_RIFT_MAX"
msgid "Did anyone else see that strange glow?"
msgstr "還有人看到那道奇怪的光嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER"
msgid "Cover confirmed. Safety first."
msgstr "已確認掩護，安全第一。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SNARED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SNARED"
msgid "Bones. Lovely."
msgstr "骨頭。真是太好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SNARED_IVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SNARED_IVY"
msgid "Please let go."
msgstr "請放開我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SOAKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SOAKED"
msgid "I'm completely soaked. Wonderful."
msgstr "全身都濕透了。真棒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SPOOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SPOOKED"
msgid "Were those bats, or am I imagining things?"
msgstr "那些是蝙蝠嗎？還是我的錯覺？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.1"
msgid "Show me your condition for today."
msgstr "讓我看看你今天的狀態。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.2"
msgid "Checking moisture and sunlight."
msgstr "確認水分和日照。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.3"
msgid "Quiet maintenance is still important work."
msgstr "默默保養也是重要的工作。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.4"
msgid "I won't miss small changes."
msgstr "再小的變化我也不會放過。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.5"
msgid "Good progress. Keep this pace."
msgstr "長得不錯，保持這個進度。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_THORNS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_THORNS"
msgid "Ouch!"
msgstr "哎喲!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_THURIBLE_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_THURIBLE_OUT"
msgid "Oh, it went out. I liked that thing."
msgstr "喔，它熄滅了。我還蠻喜歡那東西的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_ABANDONED"
msgid "I'll find those little guys on my own."
msgstr "我會自己找到那些小傢伙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_DEAD"
msgid "Poor guy... Now where was he leading me?"
msgstr "可憐的傢伙……它本來要帶我去哪裡呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_GET_LEADER_ATTENTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_GET_LEADER_ATTENTION"
msgid "He really wants me to follow him."
msgstr "他真的想讓我跟著他。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_LOST_KITCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_LOST_KITCOON"
msgid "Looks like someone else found what he was looking for."
msgstr "看起來其他人找到了他要找的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NEAR_KITCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NEAR_KITCOON"
msgid "He must have found something!"
msgstr "他一定是發現了什麼！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NOTHING_TO_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NOTHING_TO_TRACK"
msgid "Looks like he couldn't find anything."
msgstr "看來他什麼也沒發現。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_START_TRACKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_START_TRACKING"
msgid "He's caught the scent!"
msgstr "他聞到了氣味！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_WAITING_FOR_LEADER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_WAITING_FOR_LEADER"
msgid "I should follow him!"
msgstr "我應該跟著他！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPED"
msgid "Lost it. I'll take the next round seriously."
msgstr "讓它跑了。下一回合我會認真對待。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPING"
msgid "Escape attempt confirmed. Pursuing now."
msgstr "確認它想逃跑，現在追擊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_SLIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_SLIP"
msgid "Grip error. Correcting hand position."
msgstr "握法有誤，修正手部位置。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_TOOWEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_TOOWEAK"
msgid "I'll need something stronger than this."
msgstr "我需要比這個更結實的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TORCH_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TORCH_OUT"
msgid "My light has gone out."
msgstr "我的燈滅了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TOWNPORTALTELEPORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TOWNPORTALTELEPORT"
msgid "Returned. Rejoining immediately."
msgstr "已返回，立刻歸隊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TRAP_WENT_OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TRAP_WENT_OFF"
msgid "Oh!"
msgstr "喔！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_UNIMPLEMENTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_UNIMPLEMENTED"
msgid "This feature is not ready yet."
msgstr "這項功能還沒有準備好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WASHED_ASHORE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WASHED_ASHORE"
msgid "Well, now I'm all wet."
msgstr "好吧，現在我全身都濕了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WEAK_RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WEAK_RAT"
msgid "That thing's looking rather rough."
msgstr "那東西看起來狀況很差。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WEIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WEIGHT"
msgid "Weight: {weight}"
msgstr "重量：{weight}"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WEIGHT_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WEIGHT_HEAVY"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nThat's quite heavy."
msgstr "重量：{weight}\n真是相當重。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WET"
msgid "This could turn bad."
msgstr "情況可能會變糟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WETTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WETTER"
msgid "I really don't like this."
msgstr "我真的不喜歡這樣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_MISS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_MISS"
msgid "Oh, so close. I was sure that would work."
msgstr "喔，就差一點。我還以為一定能成功。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_NO_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_NO_ITEM"
msgid "Looks like I caught a whole lot of nothing."
msgstr "看來我撈了一堆空氣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF"
msgid "Body feels light. I can sharpen my movement."
msgstr "身體很輕盈，可以把動作磨得更利落。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF_OVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF_OVER"
msgid "Effect ended. Back to regular discipline."
msgstr "效果結束，回到平時的修行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WORMHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WORMHOLE"
msgid "That was not a sane thing to do."
msgstr "這可不是理智的人會做的事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WORMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WORMS"
msgid "I do NOT want to see what made that sound!"
msgstr "我一點也不想看到那聲音是什麼東西發出來的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_YOTB_LEARN_NEW_PATTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_YOTB_LEARN_NEW_PATTERN"
msgid "I think I could make a new beefalo costume now."
msgstr "我想我現在能做新的皮弗婁牛服裝了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOBOATS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOBOATS"
msgid "I seem to have drifted a bit too far from the starting point."
msgstr "我似乎離起點有點遠了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOCHECKPOINTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOCHECKPOINTS"
msgid "Alas, there is nary a waypoint to guide me in this race!"
msgstr "唉，在這場比賽中沒有一個路標可以指導我！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOTENOUGHBOATS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOTENOUGHBOATS"
msgid "Perhaps some space should be cleared around the Start Tower."
msgstr "也許應該把起始塔周圍清理出一些空間。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.BATTLECRY.DEER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.BATTLECRY.DEER"
msgid "Fair and square, I take this point!"
msgstr "堂堂正正，這一分我拿下了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.BATTLECRY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.BATTLECRY.GENERIC"
msgid "With respect, let's settle this!"
msgstr "恕我失禮，來做個了斷吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.BATTLECRY.PIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.BATTLECRY.PIG"
msgid "No carelessness. Closing distance."
msgstr "不可大意，縮短距離。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.BATTLECRY.PREY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.BATTLECRY.PREY"
msgid "I won't lose you. Pursuing."
msgstr "我不會讓你跑掉的，追擊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.BATTLECRY.SPIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.BATTLECRY.SPIDER"
msgid "Stay calm and cut clean."
msgstr "保持冷靜，乾淨利落地斬下去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.BATTLECRY.SPIDER_WARRIOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.BATTLECRY.SPIDER_WARRIOR"
msgid "Hold the line, then slash through!"
msgstr "穩住陣腳，然後一刀斬過去！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.COMBAT_QUIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.COMBAT_QUIT.GENERIC"
msgid "Retreating, are you? I'll finish it next time."
msgstr "要撤退了嗎？下次我會了結這一切。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.COMBAT_QUIT.PIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.COMBAT_QUIT.PIG"
msgid "No overchase. Resetting my form."
msgstr "不可窮追，重新調整架勢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.COMBAT_QUIT.PREY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.COMBAT_QUIT.PREY"
msgid "I'll cut you off next round."
msgstr "下一回合我會截住你。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER"
msgid "No reckless pursuit. Safety first."
msgstr "不可貿然追擊，安全第一。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER_WARRIOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER_WARRIOR"
msgid "Next exchange, I win the cut."
msgstr "下一次交鋒，這一刀由我拿下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.PROMPT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.PROMPT"
msgid "There is nothing tenseiga can do."
msgstr "天生牙也無能為力。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "Pretty petals!"
msgstr "花瓣好漂亮啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_GROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_GROUND"
msgid "I'd rather not disturb that."
msgstr "我還是不去打擾它了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_POCKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_POCKET"
msgid "Strong presence here. Handle with care."
msgstr "這裡的氣息很強，請小心對待。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL1"
msgid "It's a little strange."
msgstr "有點奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL2"
msgid "Do not provoke it. Observe first."
msgstr "不要招惹它，先觀察。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL3"
msgid "It's floating now. Well, why not."
msgstr "它現在飄起來了。嗯，有何不可呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LONG"
msgid "I think it's listening to me!"
msgstr "我覺得它在聽我說話！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.MEDIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.MEDIUM"
msgid "It's a little strange."
msgstr "有點奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.SOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.SOON"
msgid "No rushing. Follow procedure."
msgstr "不可著急，按程序來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ACCOMPLISHMENT_SHRINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ACCOMPLISHMENT_SHRINE"
msgid "I have mixed feelings about that arrow."
msgstr "我對那個箭頭的感情很複雜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ACORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ACORN"
msgid "Hello there, little tree seed."
msgstr "你好呀，小小的樹種。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ACORN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ACORN_COOKED"
msgid "Looks like you won't become a tree after all."
msgstr "看來你終究不會成為一棵樹。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ACORN_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ACORN_SAPLING"
msgid "You'll be a real tree soon."
msgstr "很快你就會成為一棵真正的樹。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ADVENTURE_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ADVENTURE_PORTAL"
msgid "Maybe that leads home."
msgstr "也許它通向家。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHAT"
msgid "It makes the inside of my head so noisy..."
msgstr "它讓我的腦子裡吵得不得了……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHATSHARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHATSHARD"
msgid "It was surprisingly hard to pull that thing apart."
msgstr "想要把那個東西拆開是出乎意料的困難。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_CONTAINED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_CONTAINED"
msgid "What a strange machine."
msgstr "真是台奇怪的機器。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.DEAD"
msgid "Heh. Take that, moon."
msgstr "呵。這下怎麼樣，月亮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.GENERIC"
msgid "We should have followed procedure with that unstable research."
msgstr "那項不穩定的研究，我們本該按程序來的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.DEAD"
msgid "Got it for sure that time."
msgstr "這次絕對解決了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.GENERIC"
msgid "You think you're tough, do you?"
msgstr "你以為自己很厲害，是嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2SPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2SPIKE"
msgid "These things are rather in my way."
msgstr "這些東西蠻礙事的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3"
msgid "Beautiful, but I'd rather keep it intact."
msgstr "很美，但我希望它能保持完好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEAD"
msgid "Guess it's finally done."
msgstr "看來終於結束了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEADORB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEADORB"
msgid "Excuse me, old friend, you may not want to stand that close."
msgstr "打擾了，老朋友，您大概不想站得那麼近。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3TRAP"
msgid "That's hardly playing fair."
msgstr "這也太不公平了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.AMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.AMULET"
msgid "I'm not sure what it does, but it feels nice to wear."
msgstr "我不知道它有什麼用，不過戴著很舒服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR"
msgid "Lowering it is easier than pulling it back up."
msgstr "放下去比拉上來容易多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR_ITEM"
msgid "Shall we build an anchor?"
msgstr "我們來造個錨吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR"
msgid "An afterlife intercom. How curious."
msgstr "來世的對講機。真有意思。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN"
msgid "The dead can't get through here."
msgstr "死人是無法通過這裡的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_STATUE"
msgid "Too dense to ignite."
msgstr "太緻密了，點不著。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANIMAL_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANIMAL_TRACK"
msgid "It might lead to a new friend."
msgstr "它也許能帶我找到新朋友。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANTCHOVIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANTCHOVIES"
msgid "Terribly salty."
msgstr "鹹得要命。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.GENERIC"
msgid "What is it you want?"
msgstr "您想要什麼呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.UNHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.UNHAPPY"
msgid "There's going to be tremors in our future."
msgstr "看來之後要地震了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY"
msgid "You're in a good mood."
msgstr "你心情很好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONHAT"
msgid "Looks unusual, but it's practical."
msgstr "樣子有點特別，但很實用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONTRINKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONTRINKET"
msgid "A bunch of odds and ends."
msgstr "一堆零零碎碎的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE"
msgid "Metal bug is angry."
msgstr "金屬蟲很生氣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE_HUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE_HUSK"
msgid "Is big pile of junk."
msgstr "是一大堆垃圾。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.BURNT"
msgid "The pot got cooked."
msgstr "鍋被煮熟了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG"
msgid "This is going to take a while."
msgstr "這需要一段時間。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT"
msgid "It's almost done!"
msgstr "快好了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.DONE"
msgid "Mmmmm! It's ready to eat!"
msgstr "嗯嗯！可以吃了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.EMPTY"
msgid "Let's dust off this old crockery, shall we?"
msgstr "來把這隻舊陶鍋上的灰撣一撣吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX"
msgid "We turned on one mysterious thing and received another. Efficient."
msgstr "我們啟動了一個神秘的東西，又得到另一個。真有效率。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.GENERIC"
msgid "I feel a puzzle coming on."
msgstr "感覺又要解謎了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.POWEROFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.POWEROFF"
msgid "Looks like it's busted."
msgstr "看來壞掉了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_MOON_STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_MOON_STATUE"
msgid "Ha! Wolfgang could carry big rock all by himself!"
msgstr "哈!沃爾夫岡一個人就能搬運大石頭！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_ORCHESTRINA_MAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_ORCHESTRINA_MAIN"
msgid "No ignition response. I'll need a different approach."
msgstr "點火沒有反應，得換個辦法。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "I should have known it wouldn't be that easy."
msgstr "我早該知道不會這麼容易。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.POWEROFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.POWEROFF"
msgid "Another portal? You don't think...?"
msgstr "另一個傳送門？該不會……？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.GENERIC"
msgid "Please, point the way."
msgstr "請為我指路。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.IDLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.IDLE"
msgid "Nothing left to find, I guess."
msgstr "我猜，沒什麼可找的了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR_ITEM"
msgid "It's humming to itself."
msgstr "它自己嗡嗡作響。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_1"
msgid "Is nice statue, but is covered in scribblemarks."
msgstr "雕像很漂亮，但上面佈滿了潦草的痕跡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_2"
msgid "Very fancy."
msgstr "非常花哨。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_3"
msgid "Is nice statue, but is covered in scribblemarks."
msgstr "雕像很漂亮，但上面佈滿了潦草的痕跡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_4"
msgid "Very fancy."
msgstr "非常花哨。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_5"
msgid "Is nice statue, but is covered in scribblemarks."
msgstr "雕像很漂亮，但上面佈滿了潦草的痕跡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.GENERIC"
msgid "Nothing suspicious about that at all."
msgstr "那個一點也不可疑呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.POWEROFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.POWEROFF"
msgid "Whatever it is, it's not working."
msgstr "不管它是什麼，它都不起作用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_PULSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_PULSE"
msgid "Wait, come back here."
msgstr "等等，回來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.GEMS"
msgid "Something's missing here."
msgstr "這裡缺少一些東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.VALID"
msgid "I doubt anyone would mind if I borrowed one of those gems."
msgstr "我想就算借一顆寶石，也不會有人介意吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORDRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORDRAGONFLY"
msgid "Another creature casing."
msgstr "另一個生物外殼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORDREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORDREADSTONE"
msgid "It will do."
msgstr "這樣就好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORGRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORGRASS"
msgid "It just feels like more hair."
msgstr "就是感覺頭髮多了點。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORMARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORMARBLE"
msgid "If you're going to fight you might as well be protected."
msgstr "既然要戰鬥，不妨先做好防護。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORRUINS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORRUINS"
msgid "Human beings probably shouldn't wear this."
msgstr "人類大概不該穿這個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORSKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORSKELETON"
msgid "Hard to hit me in this."
msgstr "穿著這個很難被打中。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORSLURPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORSLURPER"
msgid "Oh, that is damp. Very damp."
msgstr "喔，這個潮乎乎的。非常潮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORSNURTLESHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORSNURTLESHELL"
msgid "Less defense, more offense. A fair trade."
msgstr "少點防禦，多點進攻。很公平的交換。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORWAGPUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORWAGPUNK"
msgid "It looks quite sturdy. Only one way to find out, though."
msgstr "看起來相當結實。不過只有試過才知道。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORWOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORWOOD"
msgid "Now I can face the world."
msgstr "現在我可以面對這個世界了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_BRAMBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_BRAMBLE"
msgid "I think Wormwood made it."
msgstr "我想這是沃姆伍德做的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "I think it suits me."
msgstr "我覺得很適合我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT_HUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT_HUSK"
msgid "I'll keep the sharp parts facing away from me."
msgstr "把鋒利的部分朝外就好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SANITY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SANITY"
msgid "Like being wrapped in smoke."
msgstr "就像被煙霧包裹著一樣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_VOIDCLOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_VOIDCLOTH"
msgid "I think I look rather nice in red."
msgstr "我覺得自己穿紅色蠻好看的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.BURNT"
msgid "\"Don't play with matches.\""
msgstr "「不要玩火柴。」"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.GENERIC"
msgid "It says \"Thataway\"."
msgstr "上面寫著「往那邊」。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "The sign is currently blank."
msgstr "這塊牌子現在是空白的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.BURNT"
msgid "\"Don't play with matches.\""
msgstr "「不要玩火柴。」"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.GENERIC"
msgid "It says \"Thataway\"."
msgstr "上面寫著「往那邊」。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "The sign is currently blank."
msgstr "這塊牌子現在是空白的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC"
msgid "Only ashes remain."
msgstr "只剩下灰燼了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_EYE_BONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_EYE_BONE"
msgid "That eye thing must have been quite a sight before it burned."
msgstr "那隻眼骨在燒掉之前一定很有看頭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_GLOMMERFLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_GLOMMERFLOWER"
msgid "A strange flower once grew here, I think."
msgstr "我想這裡曾經長過一朵奇怪的花。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE"
msgid "I wonder what this used to be."
msgstr "不知道這本來是什麼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS"
msgid "A vegetable."
msgstr "一種蔬菜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUSSOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUSSOUP"
msgid "Smells like it tastes."
msgstr "聞起來就和嚐起來一樣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_COOKED"
msgid "Not so chewy now, are you?"
msgstr "現在不那麼耐嚼了，是嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_OVERSIZED"
msgid "I have a feeling it'll be asparagus leftovers for a long time..."
msgstr "我有預感，接下來很長時間都要吃剩下的蘆筍了……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_SEEDS"
msgid "This'll make some food."
msgstr "這可以做一些食物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING"
msgid "It's gaining power."
msgstr "它正在獲得力量。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN"
msgid "It needs time to recover. Me too."
msgstr "需要時間來恢復。我也是。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.DESTABILIZING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.DESTABILIZING"
msgid "The gateway is destabilizing."
msgstr "大門不穩定了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.OFF"
msgid "The essential components are still intact."
msgstr "重要部件仍然完好無損。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.ON"
msgid "Back in working order."
msgstr "恢復正常工作狀態。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_KEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_KEY"
msgid "There is power emanating from it."
msgstr "有一股力量從中散發出來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.OFF"
msgid "Something must power it."
msgstr "一定要有什麼東西給它供能。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.ON"
msgid "A truly unsettling light."
msgstr "真正令人不安的光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_OVERGROWTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_OVERGROWTH"
msgid "It's in some other language."
msgstr "它是用其他語言寫的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_1"
msgid "It depicts an old civilization. The people look hungry and scared."
msgstr "它描繪了一個古老的文明。人們看起來又餓又害怕。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_2"
msgid "This tablet is too worn to make out."
msgstr "這塊石板磨損得太厲害，看不清了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_3"
msgid "Something dark creeps over the city and its people."
msgstr "某種黑暗的東西籠罩著這座城市和它的人民。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_4"
msgid "The people are shedding their skins. They look different underneath."
msgstr "人們正在蛻皮。皮下的樣子不一樣了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5"
msgid "It shows a massive, technologically advanced city."
msgstr "它展示了一座規模龐大、技術先進的城市。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE"
msgid "It doesn't seem fully real."
msgstr "看起來並不完全真實。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.AXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.AXE"
msgid "It's very sharp."
msgstr "它非常鋒利。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC"
msgid "khwai-noy."
msgstr "小牛牛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.SLEEPING"
msgid "Hello!"
msgstr "你好！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK"
msgid "I could fit a surprising amount in here."
msgstr "這裡面能裝的東西多得驚人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS"
msgid "The bacon is wonderful. I'm still deciding about the yolk."
msgstr "培根很棒。至於蛋黃，我還在考慮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "The power of a great yokai—this is proof of its strength."
msgstr "大妖怪的力量，這就是強大證明。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BALLOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BALLOON"
msgid "That's practically asking to be popped."
msgstr "簡直就像在說「快來戳破我」。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BALLOONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BALLOONHAT"
msgid "A rabbit. Not bad at all."
msgstr "一隻兔子。還不錯嘛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BALLOONPARTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BALLOONPARTY"
msgid "Hey, when are you going to make a hot air balloon? I could help!"
msgstr "嘿，您什麼時候造熱氣球？我可以幫忙！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.DEFLATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.DEFLATED"
msgid "Please don't fly away."
msgstr "請不要飛走。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.GENERIC"
msgid "Clownman has mighty lungs to make balloon so big!"
msgstr "小丑有強大的肺能把氣球吹得這麼大！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY"
msgid "Is there going to be a party?!"
msgstr "要開派對了嗎？！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BALLOONVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BALLOONVEST"
msgid "It squeaks with every step. Maxwell would hate this, which is a point in its favor."
msgstr "走一步響一下。麥斯威爾一定討厭這個，這倒是它的優點。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BANANABUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BANANABUSH"
msgid "That bush is bananas!"
msgstr "這叢灌木長滿了香蕉！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BANANAJUICE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BANANAJUICE"
msgid "I... like it."
msgstr "我...喜歡它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BANANAPOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BANANAPOP"
msgid "Cold and sweet. Lovely."
msgstr "又冰又甜。真好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE"
msgid "I'd rather not, but it may help."
msgstr "我不太想用，但也許有幫助。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE"
msgid "It came out of the water. I'm not sure about it."
msgstr "它是從水裡出來的。我不太確定能不能吃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BARNACLEPITA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BARNACLEPITA"
msgid "Pita and barnacle. A fine pairing."
msgstr "皮塔餅配藤壺。很不錯的搭配。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESTUFFEDFISHHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESTUFFEDFISHHEAD"
msgid "You know, I don't think I'm that hungry after all."
msgstr "你知道，我想我根本沒那麼餓。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESUSHI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESUSHI"
msgid "I can still see the barnacle hiding under there."
msgstr "我仍然可以看到藏在下面的藤壺。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE_COOKED"
msgid "Cooking improved it."
msgstr "煮過以後好多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BARNACLINGUINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BARNACLINGUINE"
msgid "Don't mind if I do."
msgstr "那我就不客氣了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BASALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BASALT"
msgid "Too hard to break."
msgstr "太硬了，敲不開。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAT.GENERIC"
msgid "Cute little guy!"
msgstr "可愛的小傢伙！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATBAT"
msgid "Good for batting enemies away. Ahem."
msgstr "很適合把敵人「蝠」開。咳。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATCAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATCAVE"
msgid "I wonder how many bats are in there."
msgstr "不知道裡面有多少隻蝙蝠。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATHBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATHBOMB"
msgid "It smells lovely. I wouldn't mind a bath."
msgstr "聞起來真香。我倒不介意泡個澡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE"
msgid "That's... a nose."
msgstr "那個是……鼻子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATNOSEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATNOSEHAT"
msgid "Is that even a real hat?"
msgstr "這還是一頂真正的帽子嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE_COOKED"
msgid "Is that supposed to make it better?"
msgstr "這樣就算變好了嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_CONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_CONTAINER"
msgid "Whose song sheet is in the jar?"
msgstr "罐子裡是誰的歌單？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_DURABILITY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_DURABILITY"
msgid "A song to keep things from breaking. I'll hum it."
msgstr "一首讓東西不容易壞的歌。我來哼一下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_FIRERESISTANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_FIRERESISTANCE"
msgid "A song for staying cool under pressure."
msgstr "一首讓人在壓力下保持冷靜的歌。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_HEALTHGAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_HEALTHGAIN"
msgid "A song to mend wounds. Lovely."
msgstr "一首能癒合傷口的歌。真好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_PANIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_PANIC"
msgid "I'm not fond of those words."
msgstr "我不太喜歡那些詞。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_REVIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_REVIVE"
msgid "Isn't this just yelling?"
msgstr "這不就是喊叫嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_TAUNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_TAUNT"
msgid "Heh. I think I'll use that one."
msgstr "呵。我想我會用這一首。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_LUNARALIGNED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_LUNARALIGNED"
msgid "Oh, you don't want to hear me sing, do you?"
msgstr "喔，你不想聽我唱歌，是嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYAURA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYAURA"
msgid "A song to steady the mind."
msgstr "一首能穩定心神的歌。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYGAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYGAIN"
msgid "A calming song. I could use one."
msgstr "一首安神的歌。我正需要。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SHADOWALIGNED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SHADOWALIGNED"
msgid "No. I don't sing."
msgstr "不，我不唱歌。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATWING"
msgid "Not very appetizing."
msgstr "不太讓人有食慾。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATWING_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATWING_COOKED"
msgid "Still not appetizing."
msgstr "還是不太讓人有食慾。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR"
msgid "Gentlemen, please tidy your beards."
msgstr "先生們，請打理好你們的鬍子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEARGER"
msgid "Nice bear... good bear... please stay calm."
msgstr "好熊……乖熊……請保持冷靜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "That's the end of it. Rest well."
msgstr "到此為止了。安息吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Secure it properly, just in case."
msgstr "為防萬一，還是妥善處理吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "It's getting back up. Oh dear."
msgstr "它又要起來了。哎呀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEARGERFUR_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEARGERFUR_SACK"
msgid "To think we turned you into a cooler."
msgstr "沒想到我們把你做成了冷藏袋。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEARGERVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEARGERVEST"
msgid "It's like wading through fur."
msgstr "穿上就像在毛堆裡走路。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEARGER_FUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEARGER_FUR"
msgid "It's fur all the way down."
msgstr "從頭到尾都是毛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEAST_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEAST_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "My beefalo is already lucky. He gets to be my friend."
msgstr "我的牛已經很幸運了。它有我這個朋友。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_FURRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_FURRY"
msgid "It's a bit frilly for my taste."
msgstr "對我來說褶邊有點太多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_STRAW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_STRAW"
msgid "Musty."
msgstr "發黴了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's fat, but that stinger looks dangerous."
msgstr "它很胖，但是那個毒刺看起來很危險。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD"
msgid "A pocketful of bees. Not my wisest idea."
msgstr "一口袋蜜蜂。這可不是我最聰明的主意。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.BURNT"
msgid "Well. That didn't go well for the bees."
msgstr "嗯。對蜜蜂來說結局不太好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.FULLHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.FULLHONEY"
msgid "It's full of honey. Let's collect some, gently."
msgstr "裝滿蜂蜜了。我們輕輕地取一些吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.GENERIC"
msgid "Work hard, little bees. Make honey."
msgstr "努力工作吧，小蜜蜂。多釀點蜜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.NOHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.NOHONEY"
msgid "Nothing to see here."
msgstr "這裡沒什麼可看的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.READY"
msgid "The honey is ready. I'll be careful with the bees."
msgstr "蜂蜜好了。我會小心對待蜜蜂的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.SOMEHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.SOMEHONEY"
msgid "Patience."
msgstr "耐心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.BURNT"
msgid "The smoke did the trick, I suppose."
msgstr "我想那陣煙起作用了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.FULLHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.FULLHONEY"
msgid "I hope she wouldn't mind if I took just a little honey."
msgstr "希望我只拿一點蜂蜜，她不會介意。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.GENERIC"
msgid "Her bees are about as friendly as she is."
msgstr "她的蜜蜂和她差不多友善。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.NOHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.NOHONEY"
msgid "Nothing to see here."
msgstr "這裡沒什麼可看的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.READY"
msgid "I hope she wouldn't mind if I took just a little honey."
msgstr "希望我只拿一點蜂蜜，她不會介意。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.SOMEHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.SOMEHONEY"
msgid "Patience."
msgstr "耐心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED"
msgid "khwai.. khwai.. khwai..."
msgstr "牛牛……牛牛……牛牛……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.FOLLOWER"
msgid "Hm, are you following me?"
msgstr "嗯，你是在跟著我嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.GENERIC"
msgid "khwai.. khwai.. khwai..."
msgstr "牛牛……牛牛……牛牛……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.MYPARTNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.MYPARTNER"
msgid "We're khwai friends forever."
msgstr "我們永遠是牛牛好朋友。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.NAKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.NAKED"
msgid "Aww..."
msgstr "哇..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.ORNERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.ORNERY"
msgid "It looks deeply angry khwai."
msgstr "牛牛看起來氣壞了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.PUDGY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.PUDGY"
msgid "You need to burn some calories khwai."
msgstr "牛牛，你該減肥了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.RIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.RIDER"
msgid "Let's go! khwai!!"
msgstr "走吧！牛牛！！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING"
msgid "They look cute when they're sleeping."
msgstr "它們睡覺時看起來很可愛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOFEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOFEED"
msgid "I don't eat cow feed"
msgstr "我不吃牛飼料"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT"
msgid "Beast hair to go over people hair."
msgstr "野獸的毛蓋在人的頭髮上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOTREAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOTREAT"
msgid "Beefalo are easy to please."
msgstr "皮弗婁牛真容易滿足。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOWOOL"
msgid "Thick fur."
msgstr "厚厚的皮毛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.BURNT"
msgid "Well. That's the end of that."
msgstr "嗯。這下全完了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.GENERIC"
msgid "Come along, beefalo. It's time to get dressed up."
msgstr "過來吧，牛牛。該打扮一下了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.OCCUPIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.OCCUPIED"
msgid "Honestly, anything I do will be an improvement."
msgstr "說真的，我怎麼弄都會比現在好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER_ITEM"
msgid "Why is everything so much work?"
msgstr "為什麼什麼事都這麼費力？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEF_BELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEF_BELL"
msgid "Making friends is easier than I expected."
msgstr "交朋友比我想象的容易。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEGUARD"
msgid "Puffy flying!"
msgstr "胖乎乎地飛起來了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEHAT"
msgid "This should keep the bees away from me."
msgstr "這應該能讓蜜蜂離我遠一點。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEHIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEHIVE"
msgid "It's full of bees."
msgstr "裡面全是蜜蜂。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE"
msgid "It buzzes when shaken."
msgstr "搖動時會發出嗡嗡聲。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE_MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE_MAXWELL"
msgid "There are mosquitoes inside. They don't sound happy."
msgstr "裡面有蚊子。它們聽起來不太高興。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEEN"
msgid "No amount of honey is worth that."
msgstr "多少蜂蜜也不值得去惹它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "It all came from a bee, strange as that is."
msgstr "這些都是一隻蜜蜂弄出來的，真奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GROWING"
msgid "It's expanding quickly. Control it early."
msgstr "擴張得很快，要及早控制。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN"
msgid "Somebody ought to dare it. I won't, of course."
msgstr "應該有人來挑戰一下。當然，我不會去的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX"
msgid "That's none of my beeswax."
msgstr "這可不關我的事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX_SPRAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX_SPRAY"
msgid "This should preserve the plants."
msgstr "應該能把植物保存下來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEETLETAUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEETLETAUR"
msgid "You must think you're safe in all that armor."
msgstr "你穿著那身盔甲，一定覺得很安全吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BELL"
msgid "Is it New Year's Eve? I'd love to see fireworks."
msgstr "今天是除夕嗎？我好想看煙火。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_ACTIVE"
msgid "That teddy bear is moving!"
msgstr "那隻泰迪熊在動！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_BIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_BIG"
msgid "It's creepy and cute at the same time."
msgstr "既嚇人又可愛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.BROKEN"
msgid "It's all busted up."
msgstr "全壞了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "A teddy bear."
msgstr "一隻泰迪熊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRIES"
msgid "Red berries taste the best."
msgstr "紅色漿果味道最好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED"
msgid "I don't think heat improved them."
msgstr "我不覺得加熱讓它們變好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY"
msgid "Extra tasty, though they won't last long."
msgstr "非常美味，儘管它們不會保存太久。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY_COOKED"
msgid "Better eat them before they spoil!"
msgstr "最好在它們變質之前吃掉它們！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BARREN"
