msgstr "沒有生長。補充養分並繼續觀察。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BURNING"
msgid "Not much I can do now."
msgstr "我現在能做的不多。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASED"
msgid "Disease detected. Remove and contain."
msgstr "發現病害，清除並隔離。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASING"
msgid "You smell unwell."
msgstr "你聞起來不太健康。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "Mmm. Berries."
msgstr "嗯。漿果。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.PICKED"
msgid "I'd like more berries, please."
msgstr "請再給我一些漿果。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.WITHERED"
msgid "Nothing will grow in this heat."
msgstr "在這樣的高溫下，什麼都不會生長。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BARREN"
msgid "Did I say you could stop growing?"
msgstr "我有說過你可以停止生長嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING"
msgid "Not much I can do now."
msgstr "我現在能做的不多。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASED"
msgid "Disease detected. Remove and contain."
msgstr "發現病害，清除並隔離。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASING"
msgid "You smell unwell."
msgstr "你聞起來不太健康。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.GENERIC"
msgid "Ready for picking."
msgstr "可以摘了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.PICKED"
msgid "Please make more."
msgstr "請再多結一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.WITHERED"
msgid "It's drying up."
msgstr "它快要乾枯了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYSAUCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRYSAUCE"
msgid "This is the best part."
msgstr "這才是最棒的部分。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIBINGKA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIBINGKA"
msgid "Soft and spongy."
msgstr "柔軟而有彈性。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT"
msgid "What in the world?"
msgstr "這到底是什麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRCHNUTDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRCHNUTDRAKE"
msgid "A mad little nut."
msgstr "一個瘋狂的小堅果。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD"
msgid "At least he's quiet now."
msgstr "至少他現在很安靜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "A very comfortable prison for a bird."
msgstr "這是鳥兒的舒適牢房。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.HUNGRY"
msgid "What's all the fuss about?"
msgstr "有什麼大驚小怪的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED"
msgid "I've got you now."
msgstr "這下抓到你了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON"
msgid "That should probably be cleaned up."
msgstr "這或許應該被清理掉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SLEEPING"
msgid "Wake up, little bird."
msgstr "醒醒，小鳥。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING"
msgid "He won't be quiet."
msgstr "它一直叫個不停。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDTRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDTRAP"
msgid "I'm going to catch those birds. Politely."
msgstr "我要去捉那些鳥了。有禮貌地捉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG"
msgid "It smells like a bird."
msgstr "聞起來有鳥的味道。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED"
msgid "The yolk is still runny."
msgstr "蛋黃還是流動的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT"
msgid "It looks like it wants to take a bite out of me."
msgstr "看起來它想咬我一口。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT_SPITTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT_SPITTER"
msgid "Oh, two can play at that game. Ptoo!"
msgstr "喔，這招我也會。呸！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BISHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BISHOP"
msgid "It's a bishop."
msgstr "這是個主教。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_CHARGE_HIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_CHARGE_HIT"
msgid "Ow!"
msgstr "好痛！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_NIGHTMARE"
