msgstr "沒了角，你看起來有點站不穩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER"
