msgstr "這就對了。現在你站在我這邊了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC"
