msgstr "帶著電，麻麻的。真奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT"
msgid "What a look."
msgstr "這造型真不得了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE"
msgid "Life is okay when you've got a golden axe."
msgstr "當你有一把金斧頭時，生活就美好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE"
msgid "The finest pickaxe of them all."
msgstr "最好的鎬子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK"
