msgstr "發現病害，清除並隔離。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING"
