msgstr "放輕鬆，爺爺。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH"
