msgstr "這交給專業人士吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.GENERIC"
