msgstr "我覺得不錯。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC"
msgid "It's just a couple cloves of garlic."
msgstr "只是幾瓣大蒜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED"
msgid "Cooking made it better."
msgstr "煮過以後好多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS"
