msgstr "我們幾乎和這盞燈一樣高。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MEALINGSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MEALINGSTONE"
