msgstr "請再給我一些蘑菇。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION"
