msgstr "值得嗎？我認為這是值得的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR"
msgid "I won't be razing any villages, but it looks the part."
msgstr "我不會去燒殺村莊，不過這鞍看起來確實有那個架勢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WATHGRITHR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WATHGRITHR"
msgid "Goin' for that understated look, I see."
msgstr "走低調路線，我懂了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALSA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALSA"
msgid "Oh, this is nice."
msgstr "喔，這個不錯。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX"
msgid "It'll keep my stuff from rotting, for a little while."
msgstr "它能讓我的東西晚一點腐爛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK"
msgid "It's a big block of slobbery salt."
msgstr "一大塊沾滿口水的鹽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTROCK"
msgid "What a weird rock."
msgstr "多麼奇怪的岩石啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC"
msgid "That's... odd."
msgstr "那個……真奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING"
msgid "Hey, it's growing back!"
msgstr "嘿嘿，又長出來了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT"
msgid "Someone got all the salt already."
msgstr "有人已經把所有的鹽都拿走了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK"
msgid "Things are getting gritty!"
msgstr "事情變得很有沙礫感了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE"
msgid "Hit and a miss!"
msgstr "時準時不準！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
msgid "I wonder what these markings mean."
msgstr "我想知道這些標記的含義是什麼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
msgid "Where'd it go?"
msgstr "它去哪裡了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING"
msgid "So bright!"
msgstr "好亮啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED"
msgid "Maybe it needs some chicken soup?"
msgstr "也許需要一些雞湯？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING"
msgid "You smell unwell."
msgstr "你聞起來不太健康。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "It'd be worth it to pick that."
msgstr "值得摘。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED"
msgid "Poor little limp tree."
msgstr "可憐的小樹，軟趴趴的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED"
msgid "I think the heat broke it."
msgstr "我想是熱壞了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCANDATA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCANDATA"
msgid "hmmm..?"
msgstr "嗯..？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING"
msgid "It's a burning scarecrow. Poor fellow."
msgstr "一個燒著的稻草人。可憐的傢伙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT"
msgid "Just burnt straw."
msgstr "只是燒焦的稻草。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC"
msgid "He thinks he's people. Bless him."
msgstr "他以為自己是人。真是的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON"
msgid "That's unpleasant."
msgstr "真不舒服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCRAPBOOK_PAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCRAPBOOK_PAGE"
msgid "Another page for the scrapbook."
msgstr "又一頁可以放進剪貼簿。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCRAPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCRAPHAT"
msgid "Roughly made, but it should protect my head."
msgstr "做得粗糙，不過應該能保護頭部。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCRAP_MONOCLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCRAP_MONOCLEHAT"
msgid "I'll try looking through it."
msgstr "戴上看看能看見什麼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK"
msgid "I'm going to carve a stone butt."
msgstr "我要雕一個石頭屁股。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT"
msgid "Oh dear."
msgstr "哎呀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY"
msgid "I always wanted pottery lessons!"
msgstr "我一直想上陶藝課！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE"
msgid "I guess that's good, too."
msgstr "我想這也不錯。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED"
msgid "A marble statue. Not very lively."
msgstr "一尊大理石雕像。不太有生氣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "Humpty Dumpty's back together again."
msgstr "矮胖子又拼回來了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY"
msgid "It's wriggling."
msgstr "它在扭動。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "The crank won't turn."
msgstr "曲柄轉不動。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD"
msgid "I don't think that was supposed to come off."
msgstr "我想這個本來不該掉下來的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED"
msgid "It's a marble statue, I guess."
msgstr "我猜這是一座大理石雕像。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "He didn't even say thank you."
msgstr "他連聲謝謝都沒說。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY"
msgid "It's wriggling."
msgstr "它在扭動。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "That looks terrible."
msgstr "看起來糟透了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD"
msgid "Wonderful, now we've irritated a marble crime boss."
msgstr "太好了，現在我們惹惱了一位大理石黑幫老大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED"
msgid "Looks like a bunch of rubble to me."
msgstr "在我看來就像一堆瓦礫。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "I'm better at breaking things than fixing them."
msgstr "比起修東西，我更擅長弄壞東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY"
msgid "It's wriggling."
msgstr "它在扭動。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "What a creepy pile of junk."
msgstr "真是堆嚇人的破爛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE"
msgid "Ha, falling to pieces. Rookie mistake."
msgstr "哈，摔得粉身碎骨。菜鳥錯誤。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.BURNT"
msgid "Oh. Whoops."
msgstr "喔。哎呀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC"
msgid "Seafaring science."
msgstr "航海科學。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO"
msgid "What is this, exactly?"
msgstr "這究竟是什麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEASTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEASTACK"
msgid "A large sea rock."
msgstr "一塊很大的海礁。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE"
msgid "It's empty."
msgstr "空的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE_FULL"
msgid "It glows. Pretty."
msgstr "它在發光。真漂亮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEEDPOUCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEEDPOUCH"
msgid "I was getting tired of carrying loose seeds in my pockets."
msgstr "我早就受夠把散種子裝在口袋裡了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEEDS"
msgid "Farming takes patience."
msgstr "種田需要耐心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED"
msgid "No good for farming now."
msgstr "現在不適合種田了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD"
msgid "Woah! I bet it sees so far!"
msgstr "哇！它一定能看得好遠！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT"
msgid "Tool care is a basic duty. I'll repair it properly."
msgstr "保養工具是基本功。我會好好修補。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.BURNT"
msgid "All burnt up and nowhere to go."
msgstr "都燒光了，也沒地方可去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.GENERIC"
msgid "All dressed up and nowhere to go."
msgstr "打扮好了，卻沒地方可去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE"
msgid "At least something around here can hold it together."
msgstr "至少這裡有東西能把它粘住。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDANCER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDANCER"
msgid "That's pure nightmare fuel."
msgstr "這完全是噩夢燃料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER"
msgid "It's even creepier than the real one."
msgstr "比真的那個還要嚇人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART"
msgid "Who would ever touch that?"
msgstr "誰會去碰那種東西？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHADOWRIFT_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHADOWRIFT_PORTAL"
msgid "No. I'm not going near that."
msgstr "不。我不會靠近那個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HANDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HANDS"
msgid "What has two hands and no feet? Whatever that thing is."
msgstr "什麼東西有兩隻手卻沒有腳？不管那是什麼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HORNS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HORNS"
msgid "Please snack on someone else."
msgstr "請去啃別人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_WINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_WINGS"
msgid "You don't scare me. Well, perhaps a little."
msgstr "你嚇不倒我。好吧，也許有一點。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE"
msgid "All right, let's see how strange this gets."
msgstr "好吧，來看看這能有多奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE_KIT"
msgid "I have to put it together myself?"
msgstr "我必須自己組裝嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHARK"
msgid "Nice fish... good fish..."
msgstr "好魚……乖魚……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHARKBOI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHARKBOI"
msgid "Fluffy Shark."
msgstr "毛茸茸的鯊魚。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHELL_CLUSTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHELL_CLUSTER"
msgid "Just a bunch of shells."
msgstr "只是一堆貝殼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHIELDOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHIELDOFTERROR"
msgid "At least there's no eye gunk on it."
msgstr "至少上面沒有眼屎。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "Perfect for drills. Check cut line and footwork."
msgstr "很適合練習。注意刀路和步法。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Clean blade geometry. I'll refine draw and sheathing form."
msgstr "刀身線條利落。我要再精進拔刀和收刀的架勢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL"
msgid "Not great for fighting."
msgstr "不太適合戰鬥。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "Time to find something to dig up."
msgstr "該找點東西來挖了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHROOMBAIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHROOMBAIT"
msgid "A strange scent. Let's see what it attracts."
msgstr "氣味很特別，看看能引來什麼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHROOMCAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHROOMCAKE"
msgid "Cake is cake. Pass it over."
msgstr "蛋糕就是蛋糕。遞給我吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN"
msgid "How unpleasant."
msgstr "真不舒服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "emmmmm......"
msgstr "嗯嗯……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT"
msgid "It won't provide much shade now."
msgstr "現在它遮不了什麼陰了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC"
msgid "I remember learning how to make these."
msgstr "我記得學過怎麼做這個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SILK"
msgid "Mm. Smooth."
msgstr "嗯。很順滑。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE3.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE3.GENERIC"
msgid "It's making noises."
msgstr "它在發出聲音。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE4.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE4.GENERIC"
msgid "Those things unsettle me."
msgstr "那些東西讓我不安。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE5.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE5.GENERIC"
msgid "No, thank you."
msgstr "不用了，謝謝。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.GENERIC"
