msgstr "太美了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "This magic stuff is easier than expected."
msgstr "這魔法比想象中容易。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO"
msgid "Always whirling. Powerful area control."
msgstr "一直在旋轉。強力的範圍控制。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE"
msgid "I told you it wasn't just a prop."
msgstr "我就說它不只是個道具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING"
msgid "What's a weird table doing out here?"
msgstr "一張奇怪的桌子在這裡做什麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING"
msgid "Something's odd here, but I can't put my finger on it."
msgstr "這裡有點奇怪，但我說不上來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING"
msgid "Just keep your hand to yourself, alright?"
msgstr "請管好你的手，好嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE"
msgid "A standard rock formation."
msgstr "一塊普通的岩層。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL"
msgid "Another tall rock formation."
msgstr "又一塊高高的岩層。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STALKER"
msgid "I brought you back to settle things."
msgstr "我把你帶回來，就是為了做個了結。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM"
msgid "It's just bones and shadow."
msgstr "只剩下骨頭和影子了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION"
msgid "It's barely alive."
msgstr "它幾乎沒有生命跡象。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP"
msgid "The monkeys left a map to their stash."
msgstr "猴子們留了一張藏寶地圖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY"
msgid "Looks about the same."
msgstr "看起來差不多。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "Is that supposed to be something?"
msgstr "那本來應該是什麼東西嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP"
msgid "Such a nice statue. I'd hate for anything to happen to it."
msgstr "真是尊好雕像。要是出了什麼事就太可惜了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER"
msgid "The flowers grew back, but the head didn't."
msgstr "花長回來了，頭卻沒有。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL"
msgid "Carefully constructed cults of personality are vulnerable."
msgstr "精心構建的個人崇拜是脆弱的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a nice statue."
msgstr "一尊很好的雕像。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1"
msgid "Yikes. I'd cover that up too if I were her."
msgstr "哎呀。如果我是她，我也會遮起來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2"
msgid "She hasn't put her face on for the day yet."
msgstr "她今天還沒化妝。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3"
msgid "A little lantern would be nicer."
msgstr "要是一盞小燈籠就更好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL"
msgid "Scratchy metal fibers."
msgstr "粗糙的金屬纖維。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL"
msgid "Look how fast I can spin it."
msgstr "看我能轉得多快。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM"
msgid "Can't sail without that."
msgstr "沒有它就無法航行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STINGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STINGER"
msgid "It's pointy."
msgstr "尖尖的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN"
msgid "We'll need to repair it before it can help."
msgstr "修好以後才能幫忙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC"
msgid "A little help with carrying supplies."
msgstr "可以幫忙搬些物資。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT"
msgid "A hat made of straw. Simple and practical."
msgstr "稻草編的帽子。簡單又實用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT"
msgid "It's still not a bird, but it's sure stuffed like one!"
msgstr "它還是不是鳥，但肚子裡塞得和鳥一樣滿！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STUFFING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STUFFING"
msgid "From the turkey, into my stomach."
msgstr "從火雞肚子裡，到我的肚子裡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED"
msgid "It got picked."
msgstr "它被摘走了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT"
msgid "I think it's a cactus."
msgstr "我認為這是仙人掌。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED"
msgid "A succulent in a pot."
msgstr "盆裡的多肉植物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "The real treasure is the treasure we found along the way."
msgstr "真正的寶藏是我們一路走來發現的寶藏。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED"
msgid "Aw, come on!"
msgstr "哎，拜託！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER"
msgid "I could fit a lot more in there."
msgstr "這裡面還能放好多東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR"
msgid "I don't want to be here when that thing finally breaks."
msgstr "我可不想在那東西斷掉的時候待在這裡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN"
msgid "I guess I'll have to keep an eye out for falling rocks again."
msgstr "我想我得再次留意掉落的岩石。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE"
msgid "It's nice not having to worry about rocks falling on my head."
msgstr "不用擔心石頭掉到頭上真是太好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE"
msgid "I don't want to be here when that thing finally breaks."
msgstr "我可不想在那東西斷掉的時候待在這裡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN"
msgid "Somebody should really repair this."
msgstr "真的應該有人修復這個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE"
msgid "Impressive."
msgstr "令人佩服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD"
msgid "Hmm. That looks suspiciously like work."
msgstr "唔。這看起來很可疑，像是要幹活。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD"
msgid "Hmm. That looks suspiciously like work."
msgstr "唔。這看起來很可疑，像是要幹活。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF"
msgid "Perfect for people who can't make up their mind."
msgstr "非常適合那些拿不定主意的人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST"
msgid "It itches and fits funny."
msgstr "又癢又不合身。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO"
msgid "Don't mind if I do."
msgstr "那我就不客氣了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA"
msgid "It's just leaf juice. Rather nice leaf juice."
msgstr "不過就是葉子汁。相當好喝的葉子汁。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "It's a decent blade. I've handled better."
msgstr "這把劍還算不錯。我用過更好的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT"
msgid "Well, there goes the holiday."
msgstr "嗯，節日泡湯了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC"
msgid "Are we having company?"
msgstr "有客人要來嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD"
msgid "Enough food for everyone!"
msgstr "每個人都有足夠的食物！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE"
msgid "Not the season for this."
msgstr "現在不是吃這個的季節。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER"
msgid "I like my things organized."
msgstr "我喜歡把東西整理好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH"
msgid "Who even reads fishing magazines? Uh, apart from me right now..."
msgstr "誰還會看釣魚雜誌？呃，現在除了我..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION"
msgid "It looks full of bugs."
msgstr "看起來全是蟲子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TAFFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TAFFY"
msgid "Candy!"
msgstr "糖果！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD"
msgid "I don't think it wants to be friends."
msgstr "我認為它不想成為朋友。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG"
msgid "Will it hatch?"
msgstr "它會孵化嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED"
msgid "Delicious and nutritious."
msgstr "美味又營養。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "Is it shivering or am I?"
msgstr "是它在顫抖還是我在顫抖？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks like it's hatching!"
msgstr "看來要孵化了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT"
msgid "Are eggs supposed to sweat?"
msgstr "蛋也會出汗嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG"
msgid "I have a feeling this is going to take a while..."
msgstr "我有預感這需要一段時間..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT"
msgid "It should hatch any time now."
msgstr "現在它應該隨時孵化。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC"
msgid "That's quite an egg!"
msgstr "好大一顆蛋！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED"
msgid "The nest is empty."
msgstr "巢是空的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS"
msgid "It still has that birdy crunch to it."
msgstr "還是有那種鳥蛋的脆殼口感。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TAMALES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TAMALES"
msgid "If I eat much more I'm going to start feeling a bit husky."
msgstr "再吃下去，我就要撐得走樣了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC"
msgid "I feel like he understands."
msgstr "我感覺他很明白。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY"
msgid "He sure eats a lot."
msgstr "他確實吃很多。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING"
msgid "All you do is eat and sleep."
msgstr "你整天只會吃和睡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING"
msgid "Don't look at me. Find your own food."
msgstr "別看我。自己找吃的去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS"
msgid "It needs something more."
msgstr "它還需要更多的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID"
msgid "I can feel the magic."
msgstr "我感覺得到魔法。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE"
msgid "With this I can surely pass through space and time!"
msgstr "有了這個我一定可以穿越時空！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC"
msgid "This appears to be a nexus to another world!"
msgstr "這裡似乎是通往另一個世界的樞紐！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED"
msgid "There's still something missing."
msgstr "還缺少一些東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL"
msgid "Soon, the invention will be complete!"
msgstr "很快，發明就完成了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX"
msgid "This may control the polarity of the whole universe."
msgstr "這可能控制整個宇宙的極性。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK"
msgid "Tough enough to handle the most intense experiments."
msgstr "足夠堅固，可以應對最激烈的實驗。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO"
msgid "This metal potato contains great and fearful power..."
msgstr "這金屬馬鈴薯蘊藏著巨大而可怕的力量……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING"
msgid "A ring that could focus dimensional energies."
msgstr "可以集中維度能量的戒指。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF"
msgid "It's quite a rush to use."
msgstr "用起來真刺激。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "I've only seen it in books, \"Tenseiga\""
msgstr "「天生牙」，我只在書上見過。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT"
msgid "Well, I still have my memories."
msgstr "嗯，至少我還留有回憶。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC"
msgid "A tent. Good enough for tonight."
msgstr "一頂帳篷。今晚夠用了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE"
msgid "Not at all cuddly."
msgstr "一點也不好抱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE"
msgid "It's pointy and slimy."
msgstr "它又尖又粘。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS"
msgid "Unpleasant."
msgstr "不太舒服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN"
msgid "I hear little digging sounds."
msgstr "我聽到輕微的挖掘聲。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR"
msgid "It's quivering."
msgstr "它在顫抖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM"
msgid "They want a hug, I think."
msgstr "我想它們是想要個擁抱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE"
msgid "What a smell. Next time, open a window."
msgstr "這味道。下次記得開窗。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN"
msgid "It needs to cool down after that."
msgstr "之後需要冷卻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON"
msgid "I have a nasty feeling about this..."
msgstr "我對此有一種不祥的預感……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED"
msgid "Am I on the other side of the rainbow?!"
msgstr "我是在彩虹的另一邊嗎？！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "How did tiny tree get inside?"
msgstr "小樹是怎麼進來的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED"
msgid "I shouldn't be bothered by anymore prying eyes now."
msgstr "現在應該不會再有窺探的目光來煩我了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK"
msgid "What could it be?"
msgstr "會是什麼呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT"
msgid "Is burned away to dust."
msgstr "燒成灰了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "Is looking like normal chest without sparkles."
msgstr "看起來就是個普通箱子，沒有閃光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER"
msgid "That seems a bit out of place..."
msgstr "這好像有點不太對勁啊..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.THULECITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.THULECITE"
msgid "I wonder where this is from?"
msgstr "我想知道這是從哪裡來的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES"
msgid "This Thulecite crumbled to pieces."
msgstr "這顆圖勒礦碎成了碎片。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE"
msgid "It smells like burnt hair."
msgstr "聞起來像燒焦的頭髮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED"
msgid "I'm sure I can find them on my own."
msgstr "我確信我可以自己找到它們。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC"
msgid "Meow.. Meow.. Meow..."
msgstr "喵……喵……喵……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK"
msgid "Someone else found them first."
msgstr "別人先發現了他們。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY"
msgid "Looks like there's something nearby."
msgstr "附近好像有什麼東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK"
msgid "It doesn't look like there's anything left to find."
msgstr "看來沒有什麼可找的了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS"
msgid "Hey, he found one!"
msgstr "嘿嘿，他找到了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY"
msgid "They might be too far away for him to sniff out."
msgstr "也許它們太遠了，他聞不到。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING"
msgid "I should follow his lead."
msgstr "我應該跟著他走。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE"
msgid "He's leading the way for someone else."
msgstr "他正在為別人帶路。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED"
msgid "A stubborn weed."
msgstr "頑固的雜草。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE"
msgid "I guess that weed was good for something."
msgstr "我猜雜草是有好處的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC"
msgid "It's covered in warts and fungus."
msgstr "它全身長滿了疣和菌。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE"
msgid "It's packing a punch now."
msgstr "現在它很能打了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY"
msgid "It's a hole, what do you want from me?"
msgstr "這是個洞，你還想要我說什麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC"
msgid "A mutant mushroom. I'd like to study it."
msgstr "一朵變異蘑菇。我想研究一下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND"
msgid "What is that? It's smelly."
msgstr "那是什麼？很臭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN.GENERIC"
msgid "I found it at an abandoned shrine near my home."
msgstr "我在我家附近的一個廢棄的神社裡發現了它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN.RESENTMENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN.RESENTMENT"
msgid "Evil spirit, resentment, hatred, obsession, and sadness are gathered together."
msgstr "邪氣、怨恨、仇恨、執念、悲傷匯聚在一起。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOMATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOMATO"
msgid "Cutting these is a bit of a chore."
msgstr "切這些有點麻煩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED"
msgid "It just needed a few minutes of cooking."
msgstr "只要煮幾分鐘就好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED"
msgid "It will be even harder to cut now."
msgstr "現在更難切了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS"
msgid "It's just a bunch of seeds."
msgstr "只是一堆種子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT"
msgid "I'd look like quite the gentlewoman in that!"
msgstr "戴上它，我看起來就很像淑女了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN"
msgid "I thought I saw smoke, but it's only Maxwell's shadow."
msgstr "我以為看到了煙，結果只是麥斯威爾的影子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TORCH"
msgid "Something to hold back the night."
msgstr "能暫時擋住黑夜的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE"
msgid "Into my stomach, please."
msgstr "請進到我的肚子裡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE"
msgid "Who needs to walk?"
msgstr "誰還需要走路？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Magic stuff."
msgstr "神奇的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE"
msgid "I didn't want to walk, anyway."
msgstr "反正我也不想走路。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "It smells like sulfur."
msgstr "聞起來有硫磺味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX"
msgid "Crunch crunch crunch."
msgstr "嘎吱嘎吱嘎吱嘎吱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAILS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAILS"
msgid "You can't push me around."
msgstr "你別想推著我走。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR"
msgid "Electrical doo-dah, doo-dah."
msgstr "電動的嘟嗒嘟嗒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAP"
msgid "I wove it real tight."
msgstr "我把它編得很緊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE"
msgid "It's got really sharp thorns."
msgstr "它有非常鋒利的刺。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED"
msgid "That was rude."
msgstr "真沒禮貌。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC"
msgid "Do starfish usually have so many teeth?"
msgstr "海星通常有這麼多牙齒嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH"
msgid "This is a nasty surprise."
msgstr "真是個討厭的驚喜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL"
msgid "I'll want to avoid stepping on that!"
msgstr "我可得避開，別踩到它！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT"
msgid "The chest burned down."
msgstr "箱子燒沒了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "A chest for my things."
msgstr "放我東西的箱子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE"
msgid "Plenty more room for our equipment."
msgstr "能放下更多裝備了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP"
msgid "That was a dirty trick."
msgstr "真是卑鄙的陷阱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP"
msgid "Please move."
msgstr "請讓開。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION"
msgid "Tree goo."
msgstr "樹的黏液。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT"
msgid "Three times as pointy."
msgstr "尖上加尖，尖了三倍。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1"
msgid "We could still play with these, if we're extra creative."
msgstr "只要夠有創意，我們還是能玩這些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10"
msgid "Just like grandpa wears!"
msgstr "就像爺爺穿的一樣！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11"
msgid "Beep boop!"
msgstr "嘟嘟！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12"
msgid "Feels leathery."
msgstr "摸起來像皮革。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13"
msgid "It's watching us."
msgstr "它正在注視著我們。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14"
msgid "I want some hot cocoa."
msgstr "我想要一些熱可可。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15"
msgid "I don't know how to play this game."
msgstr "我不知道怎麼玩這個遊戲。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16"
msgid "I don't know how to play this game."
msgstr "我不知道怎麼玩這個遊戲。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17"
msgid "Spork. Spork. Spork. Hahaha!"
msgstr "叉勺。叉勺。叉勺。哈哈哈！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18"
msgid "I like toys."
msgstr "我喜歡玩具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19"
msgid "This toy doesn't work very well."
msgstr "這個玩具不太好用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2"
msgid "A voiceless instrument."
msgstr "一種無聲樂器。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20"
msgid "Can i dig in the dirt with this?"
msgstr "我可以用這個挖泥土嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21"
msgid "Mom had one of these."
msgstr "媽媽也有一個這樣的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22"
msgid "It's rather like our webbing!"
msgstr "這和我們的蛛網還蠻像的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23"
msgid "Are we supposed to blow on it?"
msgstr "我們應該吹它嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24"
msgid "No cookies. Yet!"
msgstr "裡面沒有餅乾。至少現在還沒有！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25"
msgid "It's stinky."
msgstr "很臭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26"
msgid "You're our cuppy cup!"
msgstr "你是我們的小杯杯！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27"
msgid "Not very practical."
msgstr "不太實用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28"
msgid "Maybe Maxwell will teach us how to play."
msgstr "也許麥斯威爾會教我們怎麼玩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29"
msgid "Maybe Maxwell will teach us how to play."
msgstr "也許麥斯威爾會教我們怎麼玩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3
