msgstr "確認有敵對行為。保持距離。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WENDY.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WENDY.REVIVER"
