msgstr "您好，%s。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WES.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WES.GHOST"
