msgstr "確認有敵對行為。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WES.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WES.REVIVER"
