msgstr "幽靈該找誰幫忙？看來是%s。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WETGOOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WETGOOP"
