#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GENERIC"
