#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.kiritzuka.3.desc
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.kiritzuka.3.desc"
msgid "Shino often skips class and gets into fights. With her extraordinary natural strength, it's no wonder everyone thinks she's a delinquent girl. She doesn't see what the big deal is."
msgstr "Shino 經常翹課打架。再加上天生怪力，難怪大家都覺得她是不良少女。她自己倒不覺得這有什麼大不了的。"

