msgstr "這款已經學會了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.ACTIONFAIL_GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.ACTIONFAIL_GENERIC"
