msgstr "總算做完一件事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT_DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT_DONE"
