msgstr "地面在塌！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.2"
