msgstr "拿著，別再弄塌地面了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.2"
msgid "That should be enough, right?"
msgstr "這回夠了吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.3"
