msgstr "這些東西直接記住了，倒省得背。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_NO_POWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_NO_POWER"
