msgstr "漏水了，快補上！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINK"
