msgstr "過來，該出發了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.ANNOUNCE_CANFIX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.ANNOUNCE_CANFIX"
